<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114578" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρέμπτομαι</span></b> , aor.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εχρεμψάμην</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Luc.
		</span></i> (v. infr.), <i><span class="en">
			Jul.
			<u>Or.</u>
			7.205c
		</span></i>:— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>clear
				one's throat, hawk and spit, cough,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Cyc.</u>
				626
			</span></i>; esp. before making a speech, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Th.</u>
				381
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. ὡς πτύσων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					<u>Protr.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱματῶδες χ.</span>
			<i>spit</i> blood, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				5.14
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῆλα χ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					163
				</span></i>
			(lyr.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλατὺ χρεμψάμενος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cat.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Pr.Im.</u>
				20
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράσα . . χρέμπτεται</span>”
				<i>are expectorant,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ruf.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
			</span></i>inc.<i><span class="en">
				4.28
			</span></i>. (Akin to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρεμετίζω.</span>)</div>
